    "obligations": [
      "OBLIGATION-1 (owner: firmware + P3): source relay_ctrl=IO16 vs firmware CS_RTD2=16 (reserved) and RELAY_BYPASS=19. One pin, two owners.",
      "OBLIGATION-2 (owner: firmware + P3): source fault_status_in=IO17 vs firmware LED_FAULT=17 (output); firmware LED_POWER=18 has no source net (IO18 unconnected in MCU).",
      "OBLIGATION-3 (owner: firmware + P3): source native USB on IO19/IO20 vs firmware RELAY_BYPASS=19 and FAULT_OUT=20. USB and relay/fault cannot share these pins.",
      "OBLIGATION-4 (owner: firmware): source discharge_ctrl=IO47 (fail-safe-low, README agrees) has no PIN_ definition in temper_pins.h.",
      "OBLIGATION-5 (owner: P1 U2 R3 map): source UART on TXD0/RXD0 (U1 pads 37/36) vs firmware UART on GPIO43/44. If module TXD0/RXD0 are GPIO43/44 under another name, the explicit R3 pin map records it; until then it is an open naming item, not an agreement."
    ]
